#: ../../source/function.prototype.name_README.md:10
msgid ""
"An ES2015 spec-compliant `Function.prototype.name` shim. Invoke its "
"\"shim\" method to shim Function.prototype.name if it is unavailable. "
"*Note*: `Function#name` requires a true ES5 environment - specifically, "
"one with ES5 getters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/function.prototype.name_README.md:13
msgid ""
"This package implements the [es-shim API](https://github.com/es-"
"shims/api) interface. It works in an ES5-supported environment and "
"complies with the [spec](https://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/6.0"
"/#sec-get-regexp.prototype.flags)."
msgstr ""

